  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "We take each term of the first binomial and multiply it by the second binomial. Then, we simplify by collecting like terms.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(t+3)(t+4) & = \\\\ t(t+4)+3(t+4) & = \\\\ {t}^{2}+4t+3t+12 & = \\\\ {t}^{2}+7t+12\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
